From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:21:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] d3d12: Refuse Map on hidden buffers; PRIVATE=0 drops UAV
 RenderTarget.

Buffer Map returned S_OK with a null pointer for a buffer placed in a
CUSTOM heap with no CPU pages; it now refuses every heap the CPU can't
see (IsCpuVisibleHeap), as it did DEFAULT.

DXMT_D3D12_PRIVATE=0 also leaves out the RenderTarget usage renderable
2D UAV textures got for MetalFX's output, so the switch reverts the
private-storage change whole for triage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/d3d12/d3d12_buffer.cpp  | 2 +-
 src/d3d12/d3d12_texture.cpp | 4 +++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/d3d12/d3d12_buffer.cpp b/src/d3d12/d3d12_buffer.cpp
index 49d6886..f7c778e 100644
--- a/src/d3d12/d3d12_buffer.cpp
+++ b/src/d3d12/d3d12_buffer.cpp
@@ -107,7 +107,7 @@ public:
     DXMT_STAT_SCOPE("buffer.Map");
     if (Subresource)
       return E_INVALIDARG;
-    if (heap_props_.Type == D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_DEFAULT)
+    if (!IsCpuVisibleHeap(&heap_props_)) // DEFAULT, or CUSTOM with no CPU pages (Private when placed)
       return E_INVALIDARG;
     if (ppData)
       *ppData = buffer->current()->mappedMemory(0);
diff --git a/src/d3d12/d3d12_texture.cpp b/src/d3d12/d3d12_texture.cpp
index dd1c85a..9b239e8 100644
--- a/src/d3d12/d3d12_texture.cpp
+++ b/src/d3d12/d3d12_texture.cpp
@@ -116,7 +116,9 @@ PopulateWMTTextureInfo(MTLD3D12Device *Device, WMTTextureInfo &InfoOut, const D3
     Usage |= WMTTextureUsageShaderRead | WMTTextureUsageShaderWrite;
     // MacNeutron: MetalFX wants its output ShaderRead|ShaderWrite|RenderTarget (and Private): a 2D UAV of a format
     // Metal renders to can then be the temporal upscaler's output, written directly (no scratch, no copy).
-    if (Desc.Dimension == D3D12_RESOURCE_DIMENSION_TEXTURE2D &&
+    // DXMT_D3D12_PRIVATE=0 (IsPrivateHeap false for every heap) leaves this out too.
+    static const D3D12_HEAP_PROPERTIES gpu_only = {D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_DEFAULT};
+    if (Desc.Dimension == D3D12_RESOURCE_DIMENSION_TEXTURE2D && IsPrivateHeap(&gpu_only) &&
         any_bit_set(Device->GetMTLPixelFormatCapability(InfoOut.pixel_format) & FormatCapability::Color))
       Usage |= WMTTextureUsageRenderTarget;
   }
